msgid "SITL with Webots"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots.rst:7
#: 23e37f2e609e4dadba41777fe37c90a4
msgid "`Webots <https://cyberbotics.com/>`__ is a multi-platform robotics simulator that has been in development since 1998 and is designed for professional use. ArduPilot has both Multirotor and Rover examples and supports the creation of new vehicles and worlds. As of writing, there is no fixed-wing support as it will require a custom `physics plugin <https://cyberbotics.com/doc/reference/physics-plugin>`__ to simulate lift."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots.rst:14
#: 66e25c14391743dc8616a83d87427f61
msgid "Currently, there are two ArduPilot Webots robot controller implementations: a python-based controller and a C-based controller."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots.rst:25
#: 82dd8e2bbbe34e99ba3c0fd8f5249bea
msgid "Webots Python"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots.rst:26
#: 7a17d73743d7406c82edd54c04934037
msgid "The Webots python controller is the newer implementation of the two options and supports the newest Webots versions (2023a and onwards). It was designed to run without compilation on all operating systems while providing an easy way to create custom vehicles and worlds."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots.rst:37
#: 56f13ab42e3d45469f10a8e37899a218
msgid "Webots C"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots.rst:38
#: b5613ddb13b9448eb4c192858e8227ca
msgid "The Webots C controller was the first Webots implementation in ArduPilot and supports Webots 2021b. This implementation also includes wind simulation through a custom physics plugin."
msgstr ""
